# Zurgo, Thunder's Decree: "During your end step, Warrior tokens you control have 'This token can't be sacrificed.'" - only
# Warrior tokens, and only its controller's (CR 109.2, 613.1f). Both players have a Zurgo and an Ashnod's Altar. Bot2's Zurgo
# attacks on turn 4 and its two mobilized Warriors outlive Bot2's own end step. In Bot1's end step on turn 5, Bot1's Zurgo gives
# nothing to a token that is not a Warrior, so Bot1 sacrifices one of its Lingering Souls Spirits, and nothing to the Warriors an
# opponent controls, so Bot2 sacrifices one of its Warrior tokens.

